<title>USA: Gpu denies talks about buying Hopewell unit.</title>
<headline>Gpu denies talks about buying Hopewell unit.</headline>
<dateline>PARSIPPANY, N.J. 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>GPU Inc Tuesday denied it is in any discussions or negotiations about purchasing Consolidated Electric Power Asia Ltd, the Asian power unit of Hopewell Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>The denial came in a brief statement made &quot;in response to press reports,&quot; which provided no further details.</p>
<p>The Hong Kong Economic Journal said Tuesday Hopewell is expected to sell 25 percent of Consolidated to GPU in a transaction worth more than HK$23 billion.</p>
<p>-- Jim Brumm 212-859-1710.</p>
</text>
